OL,3,GNEWSAHeroes celebrated at Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old boy who sought to
OL,7,Ffundraise for charity after he was
OL,8,Fdiagnosed with epilepsy was one of
OL,9,Fthose honoured at an award ceremony
OL,10,Fheld to celebrate local heroes.
OL,12,FBBC Radio Berkshire's Make a Difference
OL,13,FAwards celebrated efforts with eight
OL,14,Fcategories recognising those who love
OL,15,Fto make life better for others in their
OL,16,Farea.
OL,18,FTo date, millions of people have been
OL,19,Finvolved in Make a Difference across
OL,20,FBBC radio stations.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
