OL,3,GNEWSAHeroes celebrated at Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FHudson, from Reading, took the crown in
OL,7,Fthe young hero category after he raised
OL,8,F#1,125 ` nearly 10 times his #150
OL,9,Ftarget ` for Epilepsy Action by walking
OL,10,F150km (93.2 miles) throughout February.
